# 공개 API 계약: project_path_gateway_verify [REPORT_FILE] (기능 003 contracts/library-api-verify.md, FR-001~FR-024)
# 리포트를 지정한 검증은 리포트 쓰기 작업(op write, op move)만 변경 기록으로 남긴다.
target lib-session project_path_gateway
layer api
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.project-path-gateway
fs dir /out

# 인자 규칙과 기존 반환 2 조건 (FR-005, FR-022)
case verify-report-args-empty-string
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
call project_path_gateway_verify \e
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_verify: 리포트 파일 경로가 비어 있습니다
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 2

case verify-report-args-not-initialized
fs file /out/report.txt
content old
call project_path_gateway_verify /out/report.txt
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_verify: 초기화되지 않았습니다. project_path_gateway_init을 먼저 호출하세요
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 2

case verify-report-args-missing-data-file
fs dir /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway
fs file /out/report.txt
content old
call eval PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT=/t/root
call project_path_gateway_verify /out/report.txt
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_verify: 데이터 파일을 읽을 수 없습니다: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned eval 0
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 2

case verify-report-args-data-file-violation
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content A=a
content bad
fs dir /t/root/a
call eval PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT=/t/root
call project_path_gateway_verify /out/report.txt
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:2: KEY=경로 형식이 아닙니다
op returned eval 0
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 2
